*** Settings ***
Documentation     Adapt the platform, ELF, UART and boot contract before enabling.
Resource          ../harness/renode.resource
Suite Setup       Setup
Suite Teardown    Teardown
Test Setup        Boot Board
Test Teardown     Finish Regression Test

*** Test Cases ***
Firmware Should Announce Readiness
    [Tags]    firmware    boot    case:firmware-ready
    Wait For Line On Uart    ${BOOT_MESSAGE}    timeout=1

*** Keywords ***
Boot Board
    Prepare Regression Test
    Execute Command    mach create
    # Include any board-local C# model BEFORE loading the platform.
    Execute Command    machine LoadPlatformDescription @"${PLATFORM}"
    Execute Command    sysbus LoadELF @"${ELF}"
    Create Terminal Tester    ${UART}
    Start Emulation
